Maiq
$cards
DECK 4 SPADES

$initial
IRA 7 FACE_LAST
IRA 1 FACE_HALF
IRA 2 FACE_HALF
IRA 10 FACE_HALF
IRA 6 FACE_HALF
IRA 2 FACE_HALF
IRA 9 FACE_HALF
IRA 0 FACE_HALF
IRA 6 FACE_HALF

ZUID 8 FACE_HALF

AJO 1 FACE_LAST

$moves
MOVE ZUID AJO
AND
    OR
        DESTSRC Rank ascending
        DEST Size >= 4
    SRC Rank K
MOVE AJO IRA
DESTSRC Suit match
MOVE_STACK ZUID ZUID
OR
    SRCSTACK Suit match
    AND
        SRCSTACK Rank ascending
        DESTSRC Rank ascending
$win
PILE ALL AJO Empty
